Dialogue: 10,0:00:12.50,0:00:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oshino! Why is Black Hanekawa back?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.88,0:00:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought we sealed it away for good during Golden Week.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.09,0:00:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I never said that.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:26.33,0:00:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you? In the end, the meddlesome cat was just her impetus. Ther real problem is Prez's stress.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:34.72,0:00:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Last time, she was able to let stress off just going wild like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.75,0:00:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Se we sealed it away. But it's not gone.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.54,0:00:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If she builds up too much stress, it'll come back out.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:48.20,0:00:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Stress, huh...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:50.47,0:00:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like she has a bell around her neck.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:53.74,0:00:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That does the trick.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:56.49,0:00:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how you catch the meddlesome cat early.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:00.00,0:01:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that bell?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:03.26,0:01:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Her headaches.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:04.80,0:01:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Prez was complaining about her headaches around Golden Week too, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:08.50,0:01:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking that into account, it's like she was trying to lead you straight to it.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:11.56,0:01:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why she could only tell you.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:15.76,0:01:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, the problem is stress.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:18.26,0:01:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That means it's a matter of what's causing that stress.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:21.92,0:01:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Her family just like before, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:25.77,0:01:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder about that.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:27.89,0:01:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,She held that stress in for seventeen years.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:31.25,0:01:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It just cleared up. Could it really get that bad again this quick?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:46.83,0:01:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we've got the reason, neither you nor I can do anything about it.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:52.55,0:01:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think we have any option but to treat the symptoms when they pop up.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:58.22,0:02:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. You're right about that, but{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:03.02,0:02:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Oshino? You're being vague.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:07.18,0:02:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Prez does look pretty good in cat ears.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:13.64,0:02:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Reminds me of "Neko Neko Fantasia".
Dialogue: 10,0:02:16.55,0:02:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You read it? It was drawn by Nekobe Neko.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:19.66,0:02:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Nekobe Neko drew Goldfish Warning, not that!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:24.91,0:02:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Oshino, are you trying to trick me?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:32.08,0:02:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you bring out Shinobu?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:35.34,0:02:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We're up against a stupid cat. It's not like we have any options but her.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:41.25,0:02:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess. But, it never rains. It pours.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:46.91,0:02:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad luck brings along its friends.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:49.95,0:02:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, knock it off, Oshi{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.59,0:02:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oshino. There's something I want to ask you.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:59.85,0:03:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What a coincidence. There's something I've wanted you to ask me.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:05.26,0:03:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to Shinobu?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:07.77,0:03:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it. Shinobu-chan left on a journey to find herself.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.94,0:04:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,She's just a kid. She can't have gone very far.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:57.16,0:05:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, she's not like a vampire out of the legends anymore.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.03,0:05:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm not near her, she's even weaker than a kid.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:09.51,0:05:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if she went to Mister Donut, she doesn't have a cent to her name.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.32,0:05:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe she's hungry.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.61,0:05:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,She's somewhere in this city, alone...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.59,0:05:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Arraragi-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.59,0:05:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, just a typo...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.36,0:05:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I stuttered.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.22,0:05:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it was on purpose!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.81,0:05:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I don't have time for this.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.24,0:05:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it. I'll try as hard as I can to find her.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.51,0:05:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.69,0:05:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, Araragi-san. Finding a lost child requires a lot of careful attention.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.53,0:05:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If you try to do it all yourself, it's like finding a mummy in a pyramid.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.29,0:06:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,A pyramid? That big?!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.81,0:06:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Koyomi-oniichan! You called me?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.31,0:06:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.10,0:06:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on, Koyomi-oniichan?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.78,0:06:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, umm...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.13,0:06:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down. Did something happen?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.89,0:06:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, something's up.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.83,0:06:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Just calm down, Koyomi-oniichan. I know, I'll tell you a funny story.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.51,0:06:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... People in comics and anime seem to have it really easy,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.64,0:06:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,but being a maid must be incredibly stressful work.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:40.07,0:06:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you, "the Big Bear Cat lover"?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:44.83,0:06:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you feeling calmer now, Koyomi-oniichan?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.05,0:06:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, hearing that again calmed me down somehow.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.20,0:06:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Sengoku, I want you to look for Shinobu.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.20,0:06:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Look for her? You mean she's gone?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.99,0:07:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Err, Shinobu-chan, that is.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.52,0:07:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. She's been gone since yesterday.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.88,0:07:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Okay, got it.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.67,0:07:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep in mind that she's still a vampire, even if she's weak.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:12.40,0:07:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That's okay, I'll be fine. Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.15,0:07:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Kanbaru Suruga!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.29,0:07:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Kanbaru Suruga. My specialty is the B-dash.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:23.28,0:07:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Kanbaru Suruga. Currently employed as Araragi-senpai's love slave.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.72,0:07:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a complete and total lie!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.71,0:07:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That voice, that retort. It has to be Araragi-senpai.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.66,0:07:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course. Anyway, Kanbaru, are you at home?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:37.55,0:07:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's not like you to guess wrong.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.05,0:07:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, I'm at the supermarket's arcade machines playing "Chic Witches: Love and Berry".
Dialogue: 10,0:07:47.17,0:07:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell am I supposed to guess that?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:49.47,0:07:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I've blown almost three thousand yen on it today.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.98,0:07:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There's tons of kids lined up behind me, but I don't feel like letting them play.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.90,0:07:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit always fooling around!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:59.32,0:08:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I mustn't lose my sense of play.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:02.31,0:08:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,While we're talking about playing, lately, when I've played President with my friends...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.87,0:08:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You were "the Posturing Waggler"?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:12.08,0:08:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru. I need your help.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.68,0:08:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinobu ran away from home.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.49,0:08:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A runaway? Got it.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.02,0:08:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all you need to tell me.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.97,0:08:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That means I should strip, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.97,0:08:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, you want me to look for that cute blonde girl, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.53,0:08:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.41,0:08:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.27,0:08:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Senjougahara. Just listen to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.58,0:08:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you listen to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.74,0:08:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yesterday a friend and I went to a video rental place.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.93,0:08:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're "Walk toward the apple"?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.57,0:08:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinobu's gone. I'd like you to help find her.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.92,0:09:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this have anything to do with Hanekawa-san not coming to school?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.23,0:09:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it does.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.28,0:09:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hanekawa's{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.76,0:09:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oshino-san said last time there was a problem with Hanekawa-san, that Shinobu girl worked really hard.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.33,0:09:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's how it is.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.15,0:09:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You need her power for Hanekawa-san, but she's gone missing.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.16,0:09:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Good guess.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.54,0:09:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be worried about both of them very much.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.99,0:09:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's obvious you should put one before the other, but not doing so is very much like you.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:34.92,0:09:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.08,0:09:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.96,0:09:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.64,0:09:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm busy preparing for the school festival.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.53,0:09:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, but right now{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.66,0:09:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hanekawa-san told me to.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.79,0:09:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't just abandon it.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.16,0:09:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The worse off Hanekawa-san is, the more important it is that I do this for her.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.52,0:10:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You should do what you have to, just like usual.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.04,0:10:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll do what I have to.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.03,0:10:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.12,0:10:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, school's your problem. Let's have a great school festival.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.61,0:10:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I hope we do.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:20.81,0:10:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'll keep in touch.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.28,0:10:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the the way, Araragi-kun. Can I tell you one thing?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.21,0:10:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.13,0:10:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsundere service.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.47,0:10:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get me wrong. It's not like I'm worried about you.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:37.19,0:10:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you don't come back I'll never forgive you.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:45.06,0:10:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. Of course I'm coming back.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:50.06,0:10:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That takes a load off my back.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.69,0:10:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I've called in as much help as I can.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:10.51,0:11:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.52,0:11:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he doing?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:34.37,0:11:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinobu. Oshino Shinobu.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.91,0:11:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna find her. I have to.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:42.18,0:11:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm responsible for you for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:54.17,0:11:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.14,0:11:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Purrr.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.52,0:11:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:57.66,0:12:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't talk to me like that, humyan. Purrr.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.78,0:12:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Acting all cute isn't going to get you anywhere.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:02.92,0:12:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren't you tied up, anyway?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:05.52,0:12:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but if I feel like stirring up more trouble I can just let myself loose.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:14.41,0:12:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you sneak by Oshino?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.56,0:12:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a cat. Moving without making noise is like taking candy from a baby, meow.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:21.69,0:12:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:24.92,0:12:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oshino, you've been pretty useless this time around.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:28.39,0:12:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You let Shinobu and Black Hanekawa get away. That's not like you.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:35.83,0:12:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, cat.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:49.44,0:12:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, meow?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:52.82,0:12:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Repeat after me, cat.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.46,0:13:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you imagine an imaginary menagerie manager\Nimagining managing an imaginary menagerie?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:01.46,0:13:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fscx90}Can mew imyagine an imyaginyary mewnyagerie mewnyager imyagining mewnyaging an imyaginyary mewnyagerie?{Lined up at a seventy-seven degree angle, a sobbing and neighing 750cc bike is easily provocation level seven. lol.}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:07.59,0:13:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So damn cute!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.48,0:13:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, never mind that. I asked you, why are you here?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.85,0:13:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What, is that how you say hi?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:17.42,0:13:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I came to help you out, humyan.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.92,0:13:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:24.31,0:13:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get me wrong, humyan. I don't feel like fighting you anymore.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.79,0:13:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you that before, meow?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:31.56,0:13:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Before? You mean this morning at school?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.01,0:13:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you tell me that?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.32,0:13:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe I didn't. But it doesn't myatter, I'm telling you now.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:41.96,0:13:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't feel like going wild this time. That's not what I'm tense about, meow.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:47.98,0:13:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why are you here? You're a reflection of Hanekawa's stress.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.14,0:13:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You appeared so Hanekawa could let some of that stress off.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:55.97,0:13:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You're like another personality of hers.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:57.73,0:14:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't misunderstand, meow. This is my way of thanking you.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:03.68,0:14:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fscx95}After all, my myaster was able to work through as much stress in those nine days as she normally could in a year.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:13.45,0:14:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you mean you're on my side?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:15.74,0:14:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. You're better off the sooner we find Shinobu too.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:20.34,0:14:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, meow!{I've wanted to make her say this since this show was announced.}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:22.62,0:14:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, you can lend a hand.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:25.16,0:14:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Nyahaha. Is this what they mean by "gold coins to a cyat"?{no one cares about proverbs}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:32.64,0:14:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My Hanekawa would never be so amused by that bad of a joke!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.97,0:14:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You can help with your sense of smell and hearing. You know Shinobu's voice and scent, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:43.90,0:14:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We should follow her that way.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:46.16,0:14:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:47.85,0:14:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll drive. If you notice anything, tell me.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.17,0:15:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, humyan?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:12.92,0:15:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot about her energy drain.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.70,0:15:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see if I can get away with saying it.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:22.22,0:15:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Araragi, do not regret this!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.68,0:15:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. Humyan, my myaster's boobs felt so great that you fainted?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:31.42,0:15:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I may be dumb, but you're a moron.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:35.02,0:15:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't realize your own power, do you?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.23,0:15:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I really be counting on her?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:43.93,0:15:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gotten too dark for a human to spot Shinobu.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:48.35,0:15:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me what you've got.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:49.52,0:15:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you want to see? Nyahaha.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.20,0:16:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, humyan.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.04,0:16:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want me to do now?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.12,0:16:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really not sure I should be counting on her.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.94,0:16:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, human.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:12.10,0:16:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What, stupid cat?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:14.26,0:16:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like you went through a lot after the last time you took me on.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.72,0:16:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,With us aberrations.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:20.48,0:16:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What, Oshino told you about that?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:23.90,0:16:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. There was a crab, and a snail, and a monkey, and a snake.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:26.97,0:16:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, a nue?!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:29.58,0:16:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just react to the monkey and snake. Where are the crab and snail parts on one of those?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:34.32,0:16:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, don't just spout off whatever you think up.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:38.17,0:16:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I'm a vampire.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.03,0:16:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So, humyan, what do you think of us?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:47.49,0:16:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Of what you call "aberrations"?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:50.43,0:16:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I think of you?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:52.10,0:17:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think you're going to just get along with us, you've bitten off more than you can chew.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.50,0:17:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,An aberration is an aberration. A humyan is a humyan.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:03.92,0:17:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They cyan't be together. No myatter what, they're incompyatible.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:10.08,0:17:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it. What are you trying to tell me?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.38,0:17:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't get it, it's your own fault for being so dumb, meow.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:17.73,0:17:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You of all people saying that is really scarring.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:20.68,0:17:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is the scarred... Hm, what was it?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:28.18,0:17:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So what you mean is that I'll never be able to get along with aberrations?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:31.67,0:17:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It sure seems that way.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:34.60,0:17:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's not what I'm trying to say, meow.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:39.08,0:17:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,For example. Have you considered why that vyampire ran off?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.91,0:17:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No clue.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:47.03,0:17:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,See? That's how little you really know about us.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.41,0:17:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's purrobably why the guy in the Hawaiian shirt's guesses end up being right.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.38,0:18:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, he's at least polite.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:01.14,0:18:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Polite?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:02.41,0:18:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows his place.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.88,0:18:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We must be...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:07.09,0:18:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,believed in,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:08.19,0:18:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,feared,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:09.26,0:18:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,be afraid of,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:10.20,0:18:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,avoided,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:11.26,0:18:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,respected,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:12.29,0:18:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,worshiped,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:13.27,0:18:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,hated,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.31,0:18:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,despised,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:15.33,0:18:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and receive wishes.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:17.15,0:18:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we exist, meow.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:21.01,0:18:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting along with us is pointless. Approaching us as a friend is just annoying, meow.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:27.47,0:18:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you said that's why you exist, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:32.13,0:18:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So by treating Shinobu like a little girl, I destroyed Shinobu as an aberration?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:39.46,0:18:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Purrhaps, purrhaps not.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:43.64,0:18:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't thought it through that much.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:52.74,0:18:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I can't smell her at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.48,0:18:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't smell Shinobu?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:58.46,0:19:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you tell me just how many of her powers that vyampire can still manifest, humyan?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:02.98,0:19:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If she can still appear and disappear, or turn into a shadow, I won't be able to find her.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:08.35,0:19:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,She can't really manifest any. They only work when I'm around her.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:13.58,0:19:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm not there, she's just a ki{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.43,0:19:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, humyan. Don't you think it's going to take a bit more effort to find that vyampire?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.43,0:19:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But she can't be outside the city. Right now, she can't exist that far away from me.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:36.70,0:19:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A vyampire drinks blood, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.19,0:19:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,A vyampire drinks human blood. But drinking it for a meal and making a follower are purretty different.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.56,0:19:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:55.09,0:19:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe that's exactly why she ran away, meow.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:00.15,0:20:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:02.05,0:20:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really dense.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:04.12,0:20:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, dense?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:06.35,0:20:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,She couldn't have enjoyed watching you get involved with so many of us without even a break.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.71,0:20:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean she feels less special being held up against all of you?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:20.72,0:20:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why she couldn't stand staying there?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:23.14,0:20:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Dense.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:28.35,0:20:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do if you don't find her, anyway?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:33.29,0:20:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean? I'm screwed.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:35.81,0:20:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hanekawa won't go back to normal, either.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:37.63,0:20:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Except for what's going on with my myaster, purrhaps you'd be better off without the vyampire?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:46.14,0:20:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, with her gone, you can go back to being humyan.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:51.88,0:20:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't just let her go!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:54.91,0:20:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even care if she kills me.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:58.06,0:21:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all I know. If she dies tomorrow, I may as well die too.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:07.81,0:21:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.66,0:21:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, humyan. There's a way to bottle me byack up without relying on a vyampire.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:19.57,0:21:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,There is?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:20.85,0:21:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the purrsonification of my myaster's stress.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:23.71,0:21:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If the source of my myaster's stress is dealt with, I'll go away again.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:28.35,0:21:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oshino thought of that too, but I can't figure out what's stressing her.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:34.34,0:21:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, I'm its purrsonification.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:37.77,0:21:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I know exactly what's causing it.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:40.79,0:21:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:43.58,0:21:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And you of all people can deal with it easily.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:48.81,0:21:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Easily?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:50.91,0:21:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy as pie.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:55.79,0:21:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My myaster is so dirty.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:00.41,0:22:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She loves you, meow.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:09.48,0:22:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you fall in love with my myaster, I think that might bottle me up.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:55.32,0:23:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Karen!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:56.32,0:23:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Tsukihi!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:57.40,0:23:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Onii-chan's kind of{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:58.19,0:23:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with onii-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:59.11,0:24:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it amazing how few friends he has?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:01.24,0:24:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's amazing.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:02.95,0:24:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But we shouldn't make a point of it.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:05.83,0:24:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's not talk about it.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:06.95,0:24:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Not having friends isn't lonely!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:08.62,0:24:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Not having friends is lonely.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:09.79,0:24:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, then let's put loneliness positively!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:11.75,0:24:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you going to do that?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:13.54,0:24:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a soloist.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:14.04,0:24:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Soloist?!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:14.96,0:24:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes loneliness sound better.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:16.84,0:24:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it makes being a soloist sound worse.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:18.34,0:24:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Preview quiz!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:19.30,0:24:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Quiz!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:19.88,0:24:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You think they're a friend, but are they really?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:23.51,0:24:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's scary!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:24.43,0:24:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time, final episode!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:25.56,0:24:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsubasa Cat part five.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:26.51,0:24:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe they really are a friend.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:29.27,0:24:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's even scarier!
